<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios- Nov 12.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios- Nov 12.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
